comments.body:
@reporter can attach the full rclone log from the transfer please? This is how I would do it so you can see the log and capture it in a file.

    rclone .... 2>&1 | tee rclone.log

Unfortunately proton drive doesn't have `--dump headers` or `--dump bodies` support at the moment so it is difficult to see exactly what is going on there.

@participant2 what is the best way of debugging this?
